    '        return "Core CPI inflation pressure becoming policy-relevant"\n'
    '    if z >= 6 and e >= 0.025:\n'
    '        return "Early upside Core CPI inflation-pressure warning"\n'
    '    return "Normal Core CPI inflation policy regime"\n'
